d319><span class=\"ki\" data-v-9fe9d319>Ki</span><span class=\"magic-text\" data-v-9fe9d319>Magic</span></div></div></a><nav data-v-86ade337><ul class=\"nav-links\" data-v-86ade337><li data-v-86ade337><a href=\"/features\" class=\"nav-link\" data-v-86ade337>Features</a></li><li data-v-86ade337><a href=\"/login\" class=\"btn btn-qbo btn-nav\" data-v-86ade337>Sign In with QuickBooks</a></li></ul></nav></div></header><!----><main class=\"main-content\" data-v-86ade337><!--[--><div class=\"landing\" data-v-ebd854f0><section class=\"hero\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"hero-bg-grid\" data-v-ebd854f0></div><div class=\"hero-glow hero-glow-1\" data-v-ebd854f0></div><div class=\"hero-glow hero-glow-2\" data-v-ebd854f0></div><div class=\"hero-content\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"logo-main\" data-v-ebd854f0 data-v-9fe9d319><div class=\"logo-icon\" data-v-9fe9d319><i class=\"fas fa-star\" data-v-9fe9d319></i></div><div class=\"logo-text\" data-v-9fe9d319><span class=\"ki\" data-v-9fe9d319>Ki</span><span class=\"magic-text\" data-v-9fe9d319>Magic</span></div></div><h1 class=\"hero-subtitle\" data-v-ebd854f0>Your QuickBooks, Supercharged</h1><p class=\"hero-description\" data-v-ebd854f0> Connect your QuickBooks Online accounts. Get AI-powered reports, insights, and automated workflows — whether you use Claude or not. </p><div class=\"cta-buttons\" data-v-ebd854f0><a href=\"/login\" class=\"btn btn-qbo btn-hero\" data-v-ebd854f0><i class=\"fas fa-plug\" data-v-ebd854f0></i> Sign In with QuickBooks </a><a href=\"/features\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-hero\" data-v-ebd854f0><i class=\"fas fa-book\" data-v-ebd854f0></i> See What&#39;s Possible </a></div></div></section><section class=\"value-section\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"container\" data-v-ebd854f0><h2 class=\"section-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>How It Works</h2><p class=\"section-subtitle\" data-v-ebd854f0>Three paths, one platform</p><div class=\"paths-grid\" data-v-ebd854f0><!--[--><div class=\"glass-card path-card\" style=\"animation-delay:0s;\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"path-icon\" data-v-ebd854f0><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\" data-v-ebd854f0></i></div><h3 data-v-ebd854f0>Use with Claude</h3><p data-v-ebd854f0>Already have Claude? Connect your QuickBooks in seconds with our MCP extension. Ask questions in natural language, get real answers from your real books.</p><div class=\"path-tag\" data-v-ebd854f0>For Claude users</div></div><div class=\"glass-card path-card\" style=\"animation-delay:0.1s;\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"path-icon\" data-v-ebd854f0><i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\" data-v-ebd854f0></i></div><h3 data-v-ebd854f0>Dashboard &amp; Reports</h3><p data-v-ebd854f0>No Claude needed. Sign in with QuickBooks, get visual reports — P&amp;L, cash flow, AR aging, custom views. Your data, presented clearly.</p><div class=\"path-tag\" data-v-ebd854f0>For everyone</div></div><div class=\"glass-card path-card\" style=\"animation-delay:0.2s;\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"path-icon\" data-v-ebd854f0><i class=\"fas fa-robot\" data-v-ebd854f0></i></div><h3 data-v-ebd854f0>Automated Insights</h3><p data-v-ebd854f0>Schedule AI-powered reports. Weekly P&amp;L summaries, overdue invoice alerts, month-end close checklists — delivered to your inbox on autopilot.</p><div class=\"path-tag\" data-v-ebd854f0>Coming soon</div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><section class=\"use-cases-section\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"container\" data-v-ebd854f0><h2 class=\"section-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Built for People Who Work in Books</h2><p class=\"section-subtitle\" data-v-ebd854f0>Bookkeepers, accountants, business owners — anyone who lives in QBO</p><div class=\"demo-grid\" data-v-ebd854f0><!--[--><div class=\"glass-card demo-card\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"demo-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Financial Reports</div><p data-v-ebd854f0>Generate and visualize P&amp;L, balance sheet, cash flow — in seconds, not clicks.</p><div class=\"demo-command\" data-v-ebd854f0>“Show me P&amp;L for Q4 compared to Q3”</div></div><div class=\"glass-card demo-card\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"demo-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Close Workflows</div><p data-v-ebd854f0>Revenue recognition, bank reconciliation status, accruals — guided step by step.</p><div class=\"demo-command\" data-v-ebd854f0>“Walk me through month-end close”</div></div><div class=\"glass-card demo-card\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"demo-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Client Management</div><p data-v-ebd854f0>Multi-company support. Switch between QBO accounts, run comparisons across entities.</p><div class=\"demo-command\" data-v-ebd854f0>“Compare revenue across all my companies”</div></div><div class=\"glass-card demo-card\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"demo-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Overdue Alerts</div><p data-v-ebd854f0>Scheduled checks for aging receivables, unusual transactions, budget overruns.</p><div class=\"demo-command\" data-v-ebd854f0>“Alert me when any invoice is 60+ days past due”</div></div><div class=\"glass-card demo-card\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"demo-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Custom Queries</div><p data-v-ebd854f0>SQL-like access to your QBO data. Ask anything, get structured answers.</p><div class=\"demo-command\" data-v-ebd854f0>“Which expenses increased 20%+ this quarter?”</div></div><div class=\"glass-card demo-card\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"demo-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Business Intelligence</div><p data-v-ebd854f0>AI spots patterns you might miss — seasonal trends, margin shifts, cash flow forecasts.</p><div class=\"demo-command\" data-v-ebd854f0>“Analyze my seasonal revenue patterns”</div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><section class=\"cta-section\" data-v-ebd854f0><div class=\"container\" style=\"text-align:center;\" data-v-ebd854f0><h2 class=\"section-title\" data-v-ebd854f0>Ready?</h2><p class=\"section-subtitle\" data-v-ebd854f0>Connect your QuickBooks and see what your data&#39;s been trying to tell you.</p><a href=\"/login\" class=\"btn btn-qbo btn-cta-large\" data-v-ebd854f0><i class=\"fas fa-plug\" data-v-ebd854f0></i> Sign In with QuickBooks </a></div></section></div><!--]--></main><footer class=\"footer\" data-v-86ade337><div class=\"footer-content\" data-v-86ade337><div class=\"footer-bottom\" data-v-86ade337><h3 data-v-86ade337><strong data-v-86ade337>The Key (Ki) is that Kim is Magic</strong></h3><p class=\"footer-build\" data-v-86ade337>Build 20260324-102141-505eb55</p></div></div></footer></div></div></div><div id=\"teleports\"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{siteUrl:\"https://[hostname-redacted]\",stripePublishableKey:\"\",buildId:\"20260324-102141-505eb55\"},app:{baseURL:\"/\",buildId:\"3501050c-3bc8-4605-a4f7-f1c51da971a4\",buildAssetsDir:\"/_nuxt/\",cdnURL:\"\"}}</script><script type=\"application/json\" data-nuxt-data=\"nuxt-app\" data-ssr=\"true\" id=\"__NUXT_DATA__\">[[\"ShallowReactive\",1],{\"data\":2,\"state\":4,\"once\":7,\"_errors\":8,\"serverRendered\":10,\"path\":11},[\"ShallowReactive\",3],{},[\"Reactive\",5],{\"$suser\":6},null,[\"Set\"],[\"ShallowReactive\",9],{},true,\"\\u002F\"]</script></body></html>",
